  = must: treat this surface as planning and final-slice authority only
  = must: use docs/slices/P7_P9_Downstream_Reentry_Final_Slices.v1.sop after minting review acceptance before executing downstream slice work
  = must: keep P7 coordination work bounded to authority contracts, projection contracts, fixture plans, deferral decisions, and review records until a later source-preserved implementation activation exists
  = must: keep P9 operations-manager work bounded to safety contracts, dry-run contracts, fixture plans, deferral decisions, and review records until a later source-preserved safety activation exists
  = must: stale this surface if P6 surface implementation evidence, post-P6 surface readiness, post-IR8 readiness, IR6 coordination proof, IR7 dry-run proof, IR8 manager proof, FSC5 operations safety, operations safety canonical authority, capability field, or portion map changes
  - never: use this surface to authorize runtime assignment, dispatch, mailbox transport, adapter behavior, command execution, process control, GPU control, model runtime mutation, job control, credential access, network mutation, destructive filesystem action, persistent automation, operations control, or live machine control

& [DownstreamReentryDelta: PostP6SurfaceImplementation] is the readiness delta produced by this rebake
  + [new_support] is P6 surface implementation proof may support P7 surface participation boundaries and P9 no-live-effect proof without authorizing adapters or live operations
  + [new_support] is IR6 coordination proof may support P7 claim and mailbox carrier semantics without authorizing mailbox IO or agent dispatch
  + [new_support] is IR7 dry-run proof may support P9 dry-run and refusal semantics without authorizing command execution or live control
  + [new_support] is IR8 manager proof may support manager packet and handoff semantics without authorizing manager dispatch
  + [new_support] is FSC5 operations safety remains the standing live-control safety limit for P9
  + [blocked_support] is IRC, Matrix, browser, web, Codex, terminal, Langflow, MCP, scheduler, telemetry, adapter, or transport implementation remains blocked
  + [blocked_support] is future Ryzen 9 RTX 5090 process, GPU, model-runtime, job-control, credential, network, and live-control management remains blocked

  = must: keep the typed collaboration kernel as the source of truth and treat conversation surfaces as projections or carriers
  = must: keep the narrative, coordination, SJS, data-driven design, surface projection, and operations safety layers distinct even when a manager packet cites all of them

